  Slug: blessed-shield
  DisplayName: Blessed Shield
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/features/classes/shield-ally.webp
  Description: In your hands, a shield gains the minor Reinforcing rune. As you go
    up in level, the shield gains the reinforcing rune of your level (lesser at 7th
    level, moderate at 10th level, greater at 13th level, major at 16th level, and
    supreme at 19th level). If your shield already has the appropriate reinforcing
    rune for your level, or if it's a Sturdy Shield of the same level as the appropriate
    reinforcing rune, the shield's Hardness instead increases by 1.
